GOV-02|Governance|Security policy framework|3|Approved, communicated policy and supporting standards, reviewed on a fixed cycle.|Policy set with version history and approvals|Art.21(2)(a)|A.5.1; Cl.5.2|org.1; org.2; org.3|Art.24|Art.6
GOV-03|Governance|Roles and responsibilities (CISO, DPO, owners)|2|Security and privacy roles are named, resourced and independent where required.|Org chart, appointment letters, RACI|Art.21(2)(a)|A.5.2; Cl.5.3|org.1|Art.37; Art.38; Art.39|Art.6
