ACC-01|Access|Identity and access lifecycle|3|Joiner, mover, leaver process, periodic access reviews, least privilege.|Access review records, leaver tickets|Art.21(2)(i)|A.5.15; A.5.16; A.5.18|op.acc.1; op.acc.2; op.acc.4|Art.32|Art.9
