OPS-02|Operations|Vulnerability management and patching|3|Regular scanning, risk-based prioritisation, patch SLAs and exception handling.|Scan reports, SLA metrics, exception log|Art.21(2)(e)|A.8.8|op.exp.4|Art.32|Art.9
OPS-03|Operations|Malware protection and endpoint security|2|EDR or equivalent on endpoints and servers, centrally monitored.|EDR coverage report|Art.21(2)(g)|A.8.7|op.exp.6|Art.32|Art.9
